WEBVTT

00:09:27.355 --> 00:09:31.318
Communities around the world are
abandoning their traditional lifestyles

00:09:31.342 --> 00:09:33.339
in pursuit of material wealth.

00:09:33.870 --> 00:09:35.537
But let's not forget,

00:09:35.561 --> 00:09:37.125
the developed countries

00:09:37.149 --> 00:09:41.320
are the ones most responsible
for climate change.

00:09:41.750 --> 00:09:44.177
So we have to ask ourselves,

00:09:44.201 --> 00:09:47.766
why do we keep on following
the same blueprint

00:09:47.790 --> 00:09:50.549
when we know it causes harm to the world?

00:09:51.086 --> 00:09:54.398
We've all experienced
the consequences of our choices

00:09:54.422 --> 00:09:56.387
over the past eight months.

00:09:56.934 --> 00:09:59.531
So doing right by Mother Nature

00:09:59.555 --> 00:10:03.366
and focusing on earth-friendly,
zero-waste habits